{"seq":7,"slug":"platform-engineering","title":"平台工程","stage":"DONE","category":"devops-tools","chapterCount":5,"docCount":20,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering","rating":{"composite":4.09,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":4,"positioning":5,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.23,"verdict":"skip-for-this-profile","uScore":2}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"平台工程-简介\">平台工程 简介</h1><p>平台工程是一门将基础设施能力产品化的工程学科，它的核心目标是构建内部开发者平台（Internal Developer Platform），让应用开发团队能够通过自助式服务快速完成环境创建、服务部署和运维观测，而无需深入理解底层基础设施的复杂细节。随着微服务架构和云原生技术的普及，开发者面临的认知负荷持续增长，平台工程正是解决这一矛盾的系统性方案。</p>\n<p>本知识库面向希望系统掌握平台工程理论与实践的中高级开发者、DevOps 工程师和平台团队负责人。无论你是正在组建平台团队的技术主管、希望提升开发者体验的基础设施工程师，还是想理解平台化思维的应用开发者，这里都将为你提供从核心理念到落地策略的完整知识框架。</p>\n<p>全书共分五个章节，覆盖从平台理念到治理演进的完整知识体系：</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>平台工程基础</strong>从平台工程的定义与演进历程出发，深入内部开发者平台的架构设计、开发者体验度量指标以及平台团队的组织拓扑，帮助你建立对平台工程的全局认知。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>自助式基础设施</strong>聚焦平台的核心交付能力，涵盖黄金路径的设计理念、基础设施抽象层的构建、自助式资源供给以及环境管理策略，让开发者能够自主完成从开发到部署的全流程。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>开发者门户</strong>探讨平台的用户界面与服务发现层，包括门户架构设计、服务目录建设、API 文档平台以及新人入职自动化，将分散的工具和服务整合为统一的开发者入口。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>平台工具链</strong>深入平台底层的关键技术组件，系统讲解 CI/CD 平台设计、容器编排平台、可观测性平台以及密钥与配置管理，构建支撑整个平台运转的技术底座。</p>\n<p>第五章<strong>治理与演进</strong>讨论平台的长期运营策略，涵盖平台采纳度量、成本管理、平台 API 设计以及平台演进路线规划，确保平台持续健康地发展。</p>\n<p>建议按照章节顺序学习。如果你已有 DevOps 和云原生实践经验，可以从第二章自助式基础设施开始；如果你主要关注平台的用户侧体验，可以直接进入第三章开发者门户；如果你正在规划平台团队的长期战略，第五章治理与演进会给你重要参考。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"platform-foundations","title":"平台工程基础","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering/platform-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"platform-engineering-overview","title":"平台工程概述","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering/platform-foundations/platform-engineering-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"internal-developer-platform","title":"内部开发者平台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering/platform-foundations/internal-developer-platform"},{"seq":3,"slug":"developer-experience-metrics","title":"开发者体验度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering/platform-foundations/developer-experience-metrics"},{"seq":4,"slug":"platform-team-topology","title":"平台团队拓扑","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering/platform-foundations/platform-team-topology"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"self-service-infrastructure","title":"自助式基础设施","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering/self-service-infrastructure","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"golden-paths","title":"黄金路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering/self-service-infrastructure/golden-paths"},{"seq":2,"slug":"infrastructure-abstraction","title":"基础设施抽象","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering/self-service-infrastructure/infrastructure-abstraction"},{"seq":3,"slug":"self-service-provisioning","title":"自助式资源供给","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering/self-service-infrastructure/self-service-provisioning"},{"seq":4,"slug":"environment-management","title":"环境管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering/self-service-infrastructure/environment-management"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"developer-portal","title":"开发者门户","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering/developer-portal","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"developer-portal-architecture","title":"开发者门户架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering/developer-portal/developer-portal-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"service-catalog","title":"服务目录","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering/developer-portal/service-catalog"},{"seq":3,"slug":"api-documentation-platform","title":"API 文档平台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering/developer-portal/api-documentation-platform"},{"seq":4,"slug":"onboarding-automation","title":"入职自动化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering/developer-portal/onboarding-automation"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"platform-toolchain","title":"平台工具链","do